$Aeon::Books["yMenu","cntnt"] = "<f2>The Menu<f1> will be one of your best friends throughout your experience in Aeon, because it contains many useful features that should be utilized. Such features include: '<f2>The Catalog<f1>', '<f2>Profile Options<f1>', and a '<f2>Manual Save<f1>'. The <f3>Catalog<f1> is a very important feature that allows you to <f2>Order<f1> large, and otherwise unobtainable products, such as vehicles and building supplies that must be <f2>Air-Dropped<f1> to your general location. Note: these purchases are instantly processed and air dropped within seconds, so you must be ready to recieve the item, as it may not fall directly on top of you. In the Catalog you may select from the <f2>Deployable Packages<f1> menu, for building supplies to construct on your Property, but you must deploy these objects as soon as you can, as the <f2>Package<f1> itself is made of rapidly biodegrading material! Do not fret however, the <f2>Construction Tool<f1> can be used to modify any objects location and rotation on your Property, so you can put it in the perfect spot! Any <f2>Vehicles<f1> purchased from the Catalog, however, will immediately be registered to your name, so until it breaks down or is destroyed, it will always be where you leave it! <f3>Profile Options<f1> are used to set many various settings for your charecter. Using Profile Options one can change their <f2>Custom-Chat Name<f1>, <f2>Custom-Chat Text Color<f1>, <f2>Wealth Shown<f1>, <f2>Read Scroll Speed<f1>, <f2>Spawn Preference<f1>, and <f2>Login Information<f1>! Finally, the <f3>Manual Save<f1> can be used to manually save your stats, however this is usually unnecessary, as all of your information in Aeon is updated in Real-Time! With the Menu open, you can also view Player Statistics, including Name, Alias (Custom-Chat), Karma, and Cash! By clicking on another player's name, yourself included, you may view their wealth in the lower right hand information box, however, Players may also conceal their wealth, but not their Karma! You should fully explore and become accustomed with your Menu, it will be a powerful ally for you in the future!";